WEBVTT

00:09:59.641 --> 00:10:00.842
And they tried it,

00:10:00.866 --> 00:10:04.018
and the results were nothing
short of striking.

00:10:04.701 --> 00:10:07.359
Within hours after treatment
with tocilizumab,

00:10:07.383 --> 00:10:10.280
Emily began to improve very rapidly.

00:10:10.764 --> 00:10:14.098
Twenty-three days after her treatment,

00:10:14.122 --> 00:10:16.196
she was declared cancer-free.

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:21.078
And today, she's 12 years old
and still in remission.

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:29.816
(Applause)